---
source: tests/cli.rs
expression: "String::from_utf8_lossy(&help.get_output().stdout)"
---
Revoke the session and delete its cached token

Usage: gac logout [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -p, --profile <NAME>  Log out of the session of this profile
      --all             Log out of every configured session and legacy profile
  -h, --help            Print help

Global options:
      --session <NAME>  The [sso-session] to use; needed only when more than one is configured [env:
                        GAC_SESSION]
      --no-input        Never prompt; fail with a hint instead
  -v, --verbose...      Log to stderr: -v for debug, -vv for trace. Secrets are never logged
